Helper: leftmost-node finder for successor lookup:
```c
static rb_node_t *subtree_min(rb_node_t *n) {
    while (n->left != NULL) n = n->left;
    return n;
}
```

Helper: CLRS-style transplant (replace subtree rooted at u with subtree rooted at v; v may be NULL; guards against writing to v->parent when v is NULL since there's no sentinel):
```c
static void transplant(rbtree_t *t, rb_node_t *u, rb_node_t *v) {
    if (u->parent == NULL) {
        t->root = v;
    } else if (u == u->parent->left) {
        u->parent->left = v;
    } else {
        u->parent->right = v;
    }
    if (v != NULL) {
        v->parent = u->parent;
    }
}
```

